; ── Vedia · Blood Moon Witch ─────────────────────────────────────────
; Demo night map event

@stopBgm
@bgm stardust
@back bg02 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:50 time:0

薇狄亞.idle: Night is my stage. You came looking for me — do you want to witness true magic?

@choice "Show me!" goto:.battle_intro
@stop

# battle_intro
薇狄亞.talking: The power of the Blood Moon is not something just anyone can handle. But since you are here — let me give you a taste.

@hide 薇狄亞
@set RuneActive=true
@battle background:bg02 target:monster02 scriptName:demo_vedia label:afterbattle
@stop


; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# afterbattle
; ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

@stopBgm
@bgm stardust
@back bg02 time:0.3
@char 薇狄亞 pos:50 time:0

薇狄亞.idle: Mm... not bad at all.
薇狄亞.talking: Go and rest. The echo of Blood Moon magic can still be felt in dreams.

@hide 薇狄亞
@GotoChangeRune scriptName:demo label:aftermap
@stop
